      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SNIPPETY LEGEND (1) won well fresh before heading to town and finishing behind a smart one over 1400m in a 1MW. Fitter again for that effort and back to this level is a big tick. Loves this track and trip and is clearly the one to beat. SNIPPY SEAN (8) was 70-1 last start at Belmont in a CL3, but he wasn't disgraced there and this looks an easier assignment. Out to 1400m is a bonus now with a solid fitness base under him and he can run a much better race today. BE SEATED (6) finished impressively from the back here first-up over 1100m and the rise in trip looks ideal for him second-up where he's usually an improver. Maps nicely from a good draw and he can be thereabouts in the finish. PATCHWORK (5) can improve third-up into the campaign with the step up in trip a big tick for her. COLLECTIVE (3) bolted in recently and can play a leading role.",
